{
  "bodyHash": "i56CRqmg0qQ=",
  "content": "<p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a5486d7e-3cb1-496b-bbaa-f90207d97319.png\" width=\"590\" height=\"384\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 关于星球大战拓展</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">FazBrick Studios团队为您带来星球大战拓展。该模组持续维护并适配现代版本的Minecraft，且完全支持多人游戏。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">本项目致力于以动态而创新的方式将星球大战宇宙的绝大部分内容带入Minecraft。星球大战拓展包含飞船、武器、敌人以及新行星，将花费您大量时间探索，为您带来忠于卢卡斯影业宇宙的体验，同时为Minecraft开启全新的游戏方式。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">该模组目前包含种类繁多的武器和飞船，以及一颗可供探索并开启冒险的行星：塔图因。这颗行星拥有不同的建筑、地牢和村庄，以增强在这个新宇宙中的沉浸感。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">该模组目前处于早期开发阶段，将持续更新，添加新内容并推进版本迭代。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_be25769b-9750-4fb6-8b03-9d2897e6b75b.png\"></span></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 我可以将它放入整合包吗？</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">当然可以！请随意将此模组加入您的整合包。我们鼓励您这样做，只需别忘了注明出处即可。</span></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 星球大战拓展功能</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">星球大战拓展目前包含大量扎实的物品和建筑，让您能充分享受这次体验。</span>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>武器：&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">振动斧</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">振动刃</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">电击棒</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">加德菲棍棒</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">DL-44 手枪</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">E-11 爆能枪</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">EE-3 步枪</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">韦斯特-34 手枪</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>飞船：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">X翼战机</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">钛战机</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">陆地飞车</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">飞行摩托</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">逃生舱</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">AT-ST 步行机</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>建筑：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">绝地圣殿</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">破损逃生舱</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">塔图因村庄</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">塔斯肯营地</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">莫斯艾斯利</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">霍斯基地</span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">伊沃克营地</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>机器人：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">宇航技工机器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">礼仪机器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">刚克机器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">老鼠机器人</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">T3-M4</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">BB-8</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">战斗机器人</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>行星：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">塔图因</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">卡希克（待实现）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">霍斯（开发中）</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left;color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">恩多（待实现）</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;开始冒险</span></strong></h2><p><br><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">要开始您的冒险，您需要在主世界找到一个坠毁的逃生舱。您可以使用可合成的维修套件修复此逃生舱，使其恢复全部功能。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c9cbfe4a-7774-4f6d-b14f-5e87b6e41c9b.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">修复后，您可以登上逃生舱，通过星系行星选择系统前往星球大战拓展提供的不同行星。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d17ce253-6598-409b-b3dc-fcd33ba857dc.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">到达塔图因后，您可以探索村庄进行交易，购买新材料、物品和武器，同时收集资源用于对抗那些成为敌人的生物。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_16ac1909-4fbd-4fb7-b31a-6ca0a1f1a815.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">您可以在这些村庄中，使用在行星上收集到的金属和材料购买机器人、武器和飞船。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_67b5127b-e6e9-4fea-bee2-ed11ff6ef4b5.png\"></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">此外，您还会在行星各处发现各种绝地圣殿，在那里您可以锻造光剑，与原力合为一体。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_04b9a4e3-cd94-4aed-96b2-d9c94f7d8f7c.png\"></span></p><article>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fEoL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349915/description_7f29ea59-4f42-4a40-9fd9-b9bb44b4ae29.png\"></a></p>\n<p>🌌 即刻开启您的星球大战之旅！借助 Nitrado 和 Apex Hosting 提供的一键服务器安装，您和您的朋友可以迅速沉浸到 <strong>星球大战拓展</strong> 的史诗世界中！</p>\n<p>要开始，您只需要一个 <strong>Minecraft Java 服务器</strong>，至少配备 <strong>4GB 或更多内存</strong>（推荐用于多玩家更流畅的游戏体验）。只需在控制面板中点击一下，即可立即安装 <strong>星球大战拓展 [CurseForge]</strong>，今天就开始您的银河冒险吧！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>也来试试官方的核后时代整合包吧！</strong></h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/after-the-nukes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1349915/description_7806c8ce-bc0b-4d5b-a726-eb2796eec020.png\" width=\"475\" height=\"438\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</article><div>&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp;</div><h2><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;重新分发许可</strong></h2><p><strong>您不得在除 Curseforge 或 Modrinth 以外的网站或域名上上传或重新分发此模组。&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>这特别包括 RU-Minecraft。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>前置要求</strong></span></h2><ul>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Geckolib</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>Player Animator&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n</ul><p><strong>&nbsp; <img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/GeckoLib/bh_GL_trans.png\" width=\"158\" height=\"158\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><h6>本模组《星球大战拓展》是一个独立的粉丝项目，<strong>并未获得</strong>Mojang、卢卡斯影业有限公司、华特迪士尼公司或其任何关联公司的<strong>附属、背书或支持</strong>。<br>所有商标和版权均归其各自所有者所有。<br>使用此类名称和引用仅用于<strong>粉丝内容目的</strong>，不暗示任何关联或背书。<br>《星球大战》及其所有相关财产均为卢卡斯影业有限公司的商标。<br>本模组是一个<strong>非商业性的粉丝创作</strong>，制作时尊重所有知识产权。</h6>",
